  "notes": "HIGH CONFIDENCE — primary-tier (WITS/UN Comtrade). India world total 2024: USD 154.39M across ~107,295 MT. Note the code covers guavas and mangosteens as well as mangoes, so it slightly overstates mango alone. Unit values tell a clear story: USA at ~USD 2.88/kg vs Saudi Arabia at ~USD 0.90/kg — the US/UK/Germany trade is air-freighted premium fruit (Alphonso/Kesar) while the GCC trade is higher-volume/lower-value. Content should treat these as two different buyer conversations. Mango is also strongly seasonal (see the site's harvest calendar)."
